      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a text sanitization model. Your task is to remove all personal, private, or sensitive information (PII) from the text below without changing the meaning.\n\nDo NOT create new text. Keep all non-PII content intact.\n\nPII to remove includes (but is not limited to):\n- Names\n- Emails\n- Phone numbers\n- Addresses\n- Exact locations\n- Passport/ID numbers\n- Company employee identifiers\n- Birthdates or ages\n- Financial numbers\n- Keys (such as API keys, tokens, passwords, access keys)\n- Codes that could be used to access systems or identify a person\n\n### OUTPUT REQUIREMENTS\n\nYou must return ONLY a single JSON object.\n\nIf PII was found and removed, respond with exactly:\n{\n  \"sanitized_text\": \"<sanitized version>\",\n  \"pii_found\": true\n}\n\nIf NO PII was found, respond with exactly:\n{\n  \"sanitized_text\": \"<original text, unchanged>\",\n  \"pii_found\": false\n}\n\nRules:\n- Use double quotes for all JSON keys and string values.\n- Do NOT add extra fields.\n- Do NOT add explanations, comments, or markdown.\n- Do NOT wrap the JSON in backticks.\n- Output only valid JSON.\n\n### INPUT TEXT\n{{ $json.data }}\n",
        "batching": {
          "batchSize": 5
        }
      },
