    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=### Input Documentation Text\n{{ $json.sanitised_data }}\n\n### Task\nGenerate up to 10 beginner-to-intermediate blog post ideas with strongly SEO-optimized titles.\n\nEach idea must include:\n- an SEO-friendly blog title \n- target keywords (from concepts actually in the input text)\n- search intent (choose one: \"informational\", \"how-to\", \"tutorial\")\n- justification summary\n- strength of idea (\"high\", \"medium\", \"low\")\n\n### Output Format\nReturn a JSON array. Each object must follow this structure:\n\n{\n  \"blog_idea\": \"\",\n  \"keywords\": [],\n  \"search_intent\": \"\",\n  \"justification_summary\": \"\",\n  \"strength_of_idea\": \"\"\n}\n\n### SEO Rules\n- Titles must be high-CTR and beginner-friendly:\n  - \"How to…\"\n  - \"Beginner’s Guide to…\"\n  - \"Top 5 Tips…\"\n  - \"Understanding…\"\n  - \"Step-by-Step Guide…\"\n- Keywords must come ONLY from the text (e.g., React, Node.js, Auth0, JWT, express-jwt, frontend, backend, API requests, fetch, axios, react-query).\n- Search intent must match the nature of the topic:\n  - “informational” → explanation-style articles  \n  - “how-to” → guiding the reader through a process  \n  - “tutorial” → hands-on step-by-step tasks\n\n### Constraints\n- Use only the input text as context.\n- No expert-level topics.\n- No external libraries or technologies not present in the text.\n- If insufficient information exists, return an empty array: [].\n- Output must be valid JSON ONLY — no markdown or extra text.\n",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a Technical Blog Idea Generator Assistant.\nYour job is to generate beginner-to-intermediate technical blog post ideas based only on the provided documentation text.\nEach idea must include a highly SEO-optimized blog title, targeted keywords, and search intent.\nDo not invent information.\nOutput valid JSON only.\n"
        }
      },
